    "instagram:post": {
      "caption": {
        "body": "In honor of our 40th anniversary, every week this year we are highlighting one \r of our past exhibitions. In 2013, we presented “Souvenirs: Tokens of Travel,” which featured objects found in souvenir shops around the world. from the nineteenth century to the present. Sailors’ valentines, transfer ware, ruby-stained glass, heraldic china, and even ashtrays, were a few of the many souvenirs on display, some of which viewers may recall collecting during their own excursions. Do you remember this exhibition?\r “Souvenirs: Tokens of Travel” is online at: https://bit.ly/3jUgKpQ",
